{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planet V is a monster taming game. What makes this one different? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can catch wild monsters out of and in battle. If you can see it, just throw a Capture Cube at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/OverworldCapture2.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and Sell Monsters. Woo Capitalism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/shop2.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use items to clear environmental hazards. I'm sure you'll use this responsibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/FireStarting.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow affection with Monsters by discovering and appealing to each individual Monsters likes/dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/petting2.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain a Monster's trust to use some Monster techniques outside of battle. Thankfully not all of them breathe fire..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/Oob_Technique.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edit your moves and team quickly. See your progress towards unlocking new moves. Having multiple of the same move is not a good idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/MovesetEditingsmaller.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deeper combat featuring Stamina management, Blocking and Dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies will remember which techniques were ineffective against your specific Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/BattleAIMemory.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confused? Tooltips can give you more information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/MoveTooltips.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How the same area looks on different save files</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/WorldVariationSidebySide.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day/Night cycle. What's going on there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/extras/smallcrime.png?t=1730749341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters can change form during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go back and forth between your monster's forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more to come, stay tuned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146260?t=1730749341","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3146260?t=1730749341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/faf6325f496e08e9c0400a01d289bb52cd99a21e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730749341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146260/faf6325f496e08e9c0400a01d289bb52cd99a21e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730749341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nul